# One line ending everywhere. The repository is written on Windows too, where an editor or a
# script defaults to CRLF, and a single file flipped that way rewrites every line in a diff and
# hides the real change. Normalise on commit and check out unchanged in the working tree; the
# ported modules under src/internal/ came from a CRLF checkout and are normalised the same way.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets keep their bytes.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
